' `/petko`'s Travel moves the leader alone (MapScene.cs:1195-1207:
' `TravelToLocation` with `_debugNoTravel` sets `player.Location` and
' `player.Character.Position` only): run with `preset classic ai none seed 3
' start 30 party savefile <f>` (the leader and one companion handed over,
' a prepared state). In Paradise Camp the companion alone walks to
' 148,148; on the map /petko, Travel, New Sandez: the leader stands at its
' entry, the companion at 148,148 still — the old place's coordinates —
' and the save says so.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 110,122         ' into Paradise Camp
wait 60
press shift+right        ' the companion, alone
mapclick 150,150         ' only he walks
wait 60
press shift+left         ' the leader again
esc                      ' the world map
wait 10
type /petko
talkline 0               ' Travel
mapclick 75,303          ' New Sandez, at once
wait 30
snap petko_party_arrived
save
quit
